==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|encountren}}, from {{der|en|xno|encountrer}}, {{der|en|fro|encontrer|t=to confront}}, from {{m|fro|encontre|t=against, counter to}}, from {{der|en|LL.|incontrā|t=in front of}} itself from {{der|en|la|in|t=in}} + {{m|la|contrā|t=against}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnˈkaʊntə/|/ɪŋˈkaʊntə/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnˈkaʊntɚ/|/ɪŋˈkaʊntɚ/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-encounter.ogg|a=GA}}
* {{rhymes|en|aʊntə(ɹ)|s=3}}
* {{hyphenation|en|en|coun|ter}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[meet]] (someone) or find (something), especially [[unexpectedly]].
#: {{synonyms|en|cross paths}}
#* {{RQ:Butler Hudibras|year=1905|part=1|canto=II|page=28|passage=H' '''incounters''' ''Talgol'', routs the Bear, / And takes the ''Fidler'' Prisoner; / Conveys him to enchanted Castle, / There shuts him fast in wooden ''Bastile''.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2021 February 24|author=Greg Morse|title=Great Heck: a tragic chain of events|journal=RAIL|issue=925|page=39|text=It ran derailed for about 500 yards before '''encountering''' a set of points, which caused it to veer into the path of an Immingham-Ferrybridge coal train, powered by Freightliner 66521 (one of a class of locomotive well-known for being well-built enough to destroy anything that got in its way).}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[confront]] (someone or something) face to face.
# {{lb|en|ambitransitive}} To [[engage]] in [[conflict]], as with an enemy.
#: {{ux|en|Three armies '''encountered''' at Waterloo.}}
#* {{RQ:Marlowe Tamburlaine|part=1|scene=iii|page=49|passage=''Techelles'', and the reſt prepare your ſwordes:<br>I meane to '''incounter''' with that ''Baiazeth''.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Titus Andronicus|V|ii|passage=I will '''encounter''' with Andronicus.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|euphemistic|Indian English}} To kill or [[execute]] someone [[extrajudicially]].
#* {{quote-web|en|title=Telangana Minister says, rapist of six-year-old will be nabbed and killed in encounter|url=https://www.catchnews.com/india-news/telangana-minister-says-rapist-of-six-year-old-will-be-nabbed-and-killed-in-encounter-223185.html|work=Catch News|date=15 September 2021|accessdate=25 February 2023|text=Speaking to the media, Reddy said, "He (Accused in 6-year-old rape and murder case) should be '''encountered'''. We will nab the accused and will '''encounter''' him. We will stand by the victim's family. We console them and will provide aid to the family. We will '''encounter''' him (the accused)."}}

