===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A meeting, especially one that is [[unplanned]] or [[unexpected]].
#: {{ux|en|Their '''encounter''' was a matter of chance.}}
#* {{RQ:Chambers Younger Set|III|passage=That was Selwyn's first '''encounter''' with the Ruthvens. A short time afterward at the opera Gerald dragged him into a parterre to say something amiable to one of the amiable débutante Craig girls—and Selwyn found himself again facing Alixe.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1995|author=Maija Kalin|title=Coping with problems of understanding: repair sequences in conversations between native and non-native speakers
|passage=As they have planned the '''encounters''', they mostly have control over the time limits.}}
# A [[hostile]], often violent meeting; a [[confrontation]], [[skirmish]], or [[clash]], as between combatants.
# {{lb|en|sports}} A [[match]] between two opposing sides.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=October 29, 2011|author=Phil McNulty|work=BBC Sport| title=[http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport2/hi/football/15413593.stm Chelsea 3-5 Arsenal]| passage={{w|Andre Santos}} equalised and the outstanding {{w|Theo Walcott}} put Arsenal ahead for the first time before {{w|Juan Mata}}'s spectacular strike set up the finale for an enthralling '''encounter'''.}}
# {{lb|en|sexuality}} A [[sex]]ual encounter; sexual activity, especially unplanned or unexpected, between two people who have not already established a sexual [[relationship]] with each other. In many cases, it does not lead to a relationship, and thus is utterly [[transient]]. A sexual encounter can be [[consensual]] or [[non-consensual]]; in the latter case, it is known as [[sexual assault]]. A consensual sexual encounter that happens only once is commonly known as a [[one-night stand]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=10 October 2021 |author=Graham Bowley |journal=The New York Times |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2021/10/10/arts/bill-cosby-juror-consent.html |title=For One {{w|Bill Cosby}} Juror, the Work Did Not End With the Trial |text=Though Mr. Cosby described the sexual encounter in 2004 as consensual, Ms. Constand said she was too intoxicated to physically or verbally resist.}}
# {{lb|en|sciences}} The period of a space mission during which it carries out its data-gathering objectives.
# {{lb|en|Indian English}} An [[extrajudicial]] [[killing]] or [[execution]].
#* {{quote-web|en|title=Telangana Minister says, rapist of six-year-old will be nabbed and killed in encounter|url=https://www.catchnews.com/india-news/telangana-minister-says-rapist-of-six-year-old-will-be-nabbed-and-killed-in-encounter-223185.html|work=Catch News|date=15 September 2021|accessdate=25 February 2023|text=Telangana Labour and Employment Minister Malla Reddy on Tuesday said that the guilty person in the rape and murder of a six-year-old girl in Hyderabad "will be nabbed and will be killed in an '''encounter'''".}}

